根据球谐函数的完备性，
我觉得这并不构成所谓的“限制”，
只是我们推导出了坐标系在相应变换下新参数和旧参数的关系。

\end_layout

\end_inset
，
这对
\begin_inset Formula $\alpha_{\lambda\mu}$
\end_inset

构成了限制。
为此，

\begin_inset Formula $\alpha_{\lambda\mu}$
\end_inset

在反演变换下必须乘上
\begin_inset Formula $(-)^{\lambda}$
\end_inset

，
并且在转动变换下必须像一个球谐函数一样变换。
即如果转动了Euler角
\begin_inset Formula $\Omega=(\alpha,\beta,\gamma)$
\end_inset

的话，
应当有：

\begin_inset Formula 
\begin{align*}
(Y_{\lambda\mu})_{\text{new}} & =\sum_{\mu^{\prime}}D_{\mu^{\prime}\mu}^{\lambda}(\Omega)(Y_{\lambda\mu^{\prime}})_{\text{old}}\\
a_{\lambda\mu} & =\sum_{\mu^{\prime}}D_{\mu^{\prime}\mu}^{\lambda}(\Omega)\alpha_{\lambda\mu^{\prime}}
\end{align*}

\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
这里
\begin_inset Formula $D_{\mu^{\prime}\mu}^{\lambda}(\Omega)$
\end_inset

是转动的Wigner函数，

\begin_inset Formula $a_{\lambda\mu}$
\end_inset

是转动后参考系中的形变参数。

\end_layout

\begin_layout Booknote*
变换参考系后的径矢长度
\begin_inset Formula $R^{\prime}$
\end_inset

用新参考系中的坐标
\begin_inset Formula $\theta^{\prime}$
\end_inset

，

\begin_inset Formula $\phi^{\prime}$
\end_inset

表示为：

\begin_inset Formula 
\[
R^{\prime}(\theta^{\prime},\phi^{\prime})=R_{0}\left(1+\alpha_{00}+\sum_{\lambda=2}^{\infty}\sum_{\mu}a_{\lambda\mu}^{*}Y_{\lambda\mu}(\theta^{\prime},\phi^{\prime})\right)
\]

\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Booknote*
利用：

\begin_inset Formula 
\[
Y_{\lambda\mu}(\theta^{\prime},\phi^{\prime})=\sum_{\mu^{\prime}}D_{\mu^{\prime}\mu}^{\lambda}(\Omega)Y_{\lambda\mu^{\prime}}(\theta,\phi)
\]

\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Booknote*
得到：

\begin_inset Formula 
\[
R^{\prime}(\theta^{\prime},\phi^{\prime})=R_{0}\left(1+\alpha_{00}+\sum_{\lambda=2}^{\infty}\sum_{\mu\mu^{\prime}}a_{\lambda\mu}^{*}D_{\mu^{\prime}\mu}^{\lambda}(\Omega)Y_{\lambda\mu^{\prime}}(\theta,\phi)\right)
\]

\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Booknote*
因此要求：

\begin_inset Formula 
\[
\sum_{\mu}a_{\lambda\mu}^{*}D_{\mu^{\prime}\mu}^{\lambda}(\Omega)=\alpha_{\lambda\mu^{\prime}}^{*}
\]

\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Booknote*
利用
\begin_inset Formula $D_{\mu^{\prime}\mu}^{\lambda}(\Omega)=D_{\mu\mu^{\prime}}^{\lambda*}(\Omega^{-1})$
\end_inset

，
得到：

\begin_inset Formula 
\[
\sum_{\mu}a_{\lambda\mu}D_{\mu\mu^{\prime}}^{\lambda}(\Omega^{-1})=\alpha_{\lambda\mu^{\prime}}
\]

\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Booknote*
此即：

\begin_inset Formula 
\[
a_{\lambda\mu}=\sum_{\mu^{\prime}}D_{\mu^{\prime}\mu}^{\lambda}(\Omega)\alpha_{\lambda\mu^{\prime}}
\]

\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Booknote*
由此得到：

\begin_inset Formula 
\[
R^{\prime}(\theta^{\prime},\phi^{\prime})=R_{0}\left(1+\alpha_{00}+\sum_{\lambda=2}^{\infty}\sum_{\mu^{\prime}}\alpha_{\lambda\mu^{\prime}}^{*}Y_{\lambda\mu^{\prime}}(\theta,\phi)\right)=R(\theta,\phi)
\]

\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Booknote*
由推导中也看出了一开始引入的
\begin_inset Formula $\alpha^{*}$
\end_inset

中star的作用。

\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
为了确保
\begin_inset CommandInset ref
LatexCommand ref
reference "eq:expansion of R"
plural "false"
caps "false"
noprefix "false"
nolink "false"

\end_inset

中的径矢长度
\begin_inset Formula $R$
\end_inset

是实的，
我们必须利用性质
\begin_inset Formula $Y_{\lambda\mu}^{*}=(-)^{\mu}Y_{\lambda,-\mu}$
\end_inset

得到：

\begin_inset Formula 
\[
\alpha_{\lambda\mu}^{*}=(-)^{\mu}\alpha_{\lambda,-\mu}
\]

\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
之后可以证明，
这恰恰是
\begin_inset Formula $\alpha_{\lambda\mu}$
\end_inset

在时间反演下的行为。

\end_layout

\begin_layout Booknote*
利用上述性质，
应当有：

\begin_inset Formula 
\begin{align*}
\alpha_{\lambda\mu}^{*}Y_{\lambda\mu}+\alpha_{\lambda,-\mu}^{*}Y_{\lambda,-\mu} & =\alpha_{\lambda\mu}^{*}Y_{\lambda\mu}+\alpha_{\lambda,-\mu}^{*}(-)^{\mu}Y_{\lambda\mu}^{*}
\end{align*}

\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Booknote*
为了使它们组合出常数，
两项应当互为共轭，
得到：

\begin_inset Formula 
\[
\alpha_{\lambda\mu}^{*}=(-)^{\mu}\alpha_{\lambda,-\mu}
\]

\end_inset

\end_layout

