\hat{p}_{\lambda\mu} & =B_{\lambda}\dot{\hat{\alpha}}_{\lambda\mu}^{*}=B_{\lambda}\sum_{\mu^{\prime}}D_{\mu^{\prime}\mu}^{\lambda*}(\Omega)\dot{\hat{\alpha}}_{\lambda\mu^{\prime}}^{*}\\
