noprefix "false"
nolink "false"

\end_inset

对比，
得：

\begin_inset Formula 
\[
B_{\lambda}=\frac{\rho mR_{0}^{5}}{\lambda}=\frac{3}{4\mathrm{\pi}\lambda}A\cdot mR_{0}^{2}
\]

\end_inset

\end_layout

