\begin_layout Standard
由于我们假设了不可压缩性，
因此体积项是与形变无关的。
然而这只对普通液体正确，
事实上，
在第十三章中我们可以看到，
对量子液体而言体积项会有一个微小的改变。
当然在通常的处理中，
体积项并不需要考虑，
因此形变能只有两项，
分别是表面能和库仑能。
在第十三章我们会讨论更多细节，
并得到这仅仅对于单极和偶极形变是足够的。

\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
形变能被定义为形变液滴和球形液滴的能量差：

\begin_inset Formula 
\[
V(\alpha)=E_{S}(\alpha)-E_{S}(0)+E_{C}(\alpha)-E_{C}(0)
\]

\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
表面能可以由表面积和表面张力系数
\begin_inset Formula $\sigma$
\end_inset

相乘得到。
类似
\begin_inset CommandInset ref
LatexCommand ref
reference "eq:kinetic energy of little alpha"
plural "false"
caps "false"
noprefix "false"
nolink "false"

\end_inset

的推导

\begin_inset Flex Comment
status collapsed

\begin_layout Plain Layout
相似你个大头鬼。

\end_layout

\end_inset
，
我们可以得到至多到
\begin_inset Formula $\alpha_{\lambda\mu}$
\end_inset

二阶的表面能：

\begin_inset Formula 
\[
E_{S}(\alpha)=\sigma\oint_{S}\mathrm{d}S=E_{S}(0)+\frac{1}{2}\sum_{\lambda\mu}(\lambda-1)(\lambda+2)R_{0}^{2}\sigma\left|\alpha_{\lambda\mu}\right|^{2}
\]

\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Booknote*
利用梯度求出垂直于
\begin_inset Formula $R(\theta,\phi)$
\end_inset

的矢量：

\begin_inset Formula 
\begin{align*}
\nabla R(\theta,\phi) & =\frac{1}{r}\frac{\partial}{\partial\theta}R(\theta,\phi)\hat{\boldsymbol{e}}_{\theta}+\frac{1}{r\sin\theta}\frac{\partial}{\partial\phi}R(\theta,\phi)\hat{\boldsymbol{e}}_{\phi}\\
\nabla(r-R(\theta,\phi)) & =\hat{\boldsymbol{e}}_{r}-\nabla R(\theta,\phi)
\end{align*}

\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Booknote*
这个矢量的模为：

\begin_inset Formula 
\[
\left|\hat{\boldsymbol{e}}_{r}-\nabla R\right|=\sqrt{1+(\nabla R)^{2}}
\]

\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Booknote*
\begin_inset Formula $R(\theta,\phi)$
\end_inset

面元与球面元的夹角等于该矢量和
\begin_inset Formula $\hat{\boldsymbol{e}}_{r}$
\end_inset

的夹角：

\begin_inset Formula 
\[
\cos\alpha=\frac{(\hat{\boldsymbol{e}}_{r}-\nabla R)\cdot\hat{\boldsymbol{e}}_{r}}{\left|\hat{\boldsymbol{e}}_{r}-\nabla R\right|}=\frac{1}{\sqrt{1+(\nabla R)^{2}}}
\]

\end_inset

由此
\begin_inset Formula $R(\theta,\phi)$
\end_inset

面元为：

\begin_inset Formula 
\[
\frac{R^{2}\mathrm{d}\Omega}{\cos\alpha}=R^{2}\sqrt{1+(\nabla R)^{2}}\,\mathrm{d}\Omega
\]

\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Booknote*
由此可以得到表面能为：

\begin_inset Formula 
\begin{align*}
E_{S}(\alpha) & =\sigma\int R^{2}\sqrt{1+(\nabla R)^{2}}\,\mathrm{d}\Omega
\end{align*}

\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Booknote*
可以发现，

\begin_inset Formula $\nabla R\sim\alpha$
\end_inset

，
保留到二阶，
可以得到：

\begin_inset Formula 
\begin{align*}
E_{S}(\alpha) & =\sigma\int R^{2}[1+\frac{1}{2}(\nabla R)^{2}]\,\mathrm{d}\Omega\\
 & =\sigma\int R^{2}\,\mathrm{d}\Omega+\frac{\sigma}{2}\int R^{2}(\nabla R)^{2}\,\mathrm{d}\Omega
\end{align*}

\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Booknote*
其中用到了
\begin_inset Formula $R\sim1+O(\alpha)$
\end_inset

。
现在我们分别计算这两项，
保留到二阶，
注意，

\begin_inset Formula $\alpha_{00}$
\end_inset

本身就是二阶的，
于是第一项容易计算为：

\begin_inset Formula 
\begin{align*}
\sigma\int R^{2}\,\mathrm{d}\Omega & =\sigma R_{0}^{2}\int\left(1+\alpha_{00}+\sum_{\lambda\mu}\alpha_{\lambda\mu}^{*}Y_{\lambda\mu}(\Omega)\right)^{2}\,\mathrm{d}\Omega\\
 & =\sigma R_{0}^{2}\int\left[1+2\alpha_{00}+\left(\sum_{\lambda\mu}\alpha_{\lambda\mu}^{*}Y_{\lambda\mu}(\Omega)\right)^{2}\right]\,\mathrm{d}\Omega\\
 & =E_{S}(0)+2\sigma R_{0}^{2}\cdot4\mathrm{\pi}\alpha_{00}+\sigma R_{0}^{2}\sum_{\lambda\mu}\left|\alpha_{\lambda\mu}\right|^{2}\\
 & =E_{S}(0)-\sigma R_{0}^{2}\sum_{\lambda\mu}\left|\alpha_{\lambda\mu}\right|^{2}
\end{align*}

\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Booknote*
这里利用了
\begin_inset Formula $4\mathrm{\pi}\alpha_{00}=-\sum_{\mu\nu}\left|\alpha_{\lambda\mu}\right|^{2}$
\end_inset

。

\end_layout

\begin_layout Booknote*
第二项为：

\begin_inset Formula 
\begin{align*}
\frac{\sigma}{2}\int R^{2}(\nabla R)^{2}\,\mathrm{d}\Omega & =\frac{\sigma R_{0}^{2}}{2}\int R^{2}(\sum_{\lambda\mu}\alpha_{\lambda\mu}\nabla Y_{\lambda\mu}^{*})\cdot(\sum_{\lambda^{\prime}\mu^{\prime}}\alpha_{\lambda^{\prime}\mu^{\prime}}^{*}\nabla Y_{\lambda^{\prime}\mu^{\prime}})\,\mathrm{d}\Omega\\
 & =\frac{\sigma R_{0}^{2}}{2}\sum_{\lambda\mu}\sum_{\lambda^{\prime}\mu^{\prime}}\alpha_{\lambda\mu}\alpha_{\lambda^{\prime}\mu^{\prime}}^{*}\int R^{2}\nabla Y_{\lambda\mu}^{*}\cdot\nabla Y_{\lambda^{\prime}\mu^{\prime}}\,\mathrm{d}\Omega
\end{align*}

\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Booknote*
为了进一步计算，
我们需要知道，

\begin_inset Formula $R\nabla Y_{\lambda\mu}$
\end_inset

被称为矢量球谐函数
\begin_inset Formula $\boldsymbol{Y}_{\lambda\mu}$
\end_inset

\begin_inset Flex Comment
status collapsed

\begin_layout Plain Layout
这实际上是三种矢量球谐函数中的一种，
这里前面的
\begin_inset Formula $R$
\end_inset

是为了消去梯度中的
\begin_inset Formula $1/R$
\end_inset

，
至于为什么梯度中是
\begin_inset Formula $R$
\end_inset

而不是小
\begin_inset Formula $r$
\end_inset

，
是因为我们求梯度时的坐标为
\begin_inset Formula $(R,\theta,\phi)$
\end_inset

。

\end_layout

\end_inset
，
矢量球谐函数具有性质：

\begin_inset Formula 
\[
\int\boldsymbol{Y}_{\lambda\mu}^{*}\boldsymbol{Y}_{\lambda^{\prime}\mu^{\prime}}\,\mathrm{d}\Omega=\lambda(\lambda+1)\delta_{\lambda\lambda^{\prime}}\delta_{\mu\mu^{\prime}}
\]

\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Booknote*
由此，
我们得到第二项为：

\begin_inset Formula 
\[
\frac{\sigma}{2}\int R^{2}(\nabla R)^{2}\,\mathrm{d}\Omega=\frac{\sigma R_{0}^{2}}{2}\sum_{\lambda\mu}\lambda(\lambda+1)\left|\alpha_{\lambda\mu}\right|^{2}
\]

\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Booknote*
两项相加，
得：

\begin_inset Formula 
\[
E_{S}(\alpha)=E_{S}(0)+\frac{\sigma R_{0}^{2}}{2}\sum_{\lambda\mu}(\lambda-1)(\lambda+2)\left|\alpha_{\lambda\mu}\right|^{2}
\]

\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
库仑能
\begin_inset Formula $E_{C}$
\end_inset

可以由体积元之间的相互作用求和得到

\begin_inset Flex Comment
status open

\begin_layout Plain Layout
Peter Ring也会写错这么简单的公式啊，
这里实际上应该是：

\begin_inset Formula 
\[
E_{C}(\alpha)=\frac{1}{2}\int\int\frac{\rho(\boldsymbol{r}_{1})\rho(\boldsymbol{r}_{2})}{\left|\boldsymbol{r}_{1}-\boldsymbol{r}_{2}\right|}\mathrm{d}^{3}\boldsymbol{r}_{1}\mathrm{d}^{3}\boldsymbol{r}_{2}=\frac{1}{2}\frac{(Ze)^{2}}{V^{2}}\int\int_{V}\frac{\mathrm{d}^{3}\boldsymbol{r}_{1}\mathrm{d}^{3}\boldsymbol{r}_{2}}{\left|\boldsymbol{r}_{1}-\boldsymbol{r}_{2}\right|}
\]

\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Plain Layout
其中
\begin_inset Formula $V=4\mathrm{\pi}R_{0}^{3}/3$
\end_inset

。

\end_layout

\end_inset
：

\begin_inset Formula 
\[
E_{C}(\alpha)=(Ze)^{2}\int\int_{V}\frac{\mathrm{d}^{3}\boldsymbol{r}_{1}\mathrm{d}^{3}\boldsymbol{r}_{2}}{\left|\boldsymbol{r}_{1}-\boldsymbol{r}_{2}\right|}=E_{C}(0)-\frac{1}{2}\sum_{\lambda\mu}\frac{3(\lambda-1)(Ze)^{2}}{2\mathrm{\pi}(2\lambda+1)R_{0}}\left|\alpha_{\lambda\mu}\right|^{2}
\]

\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Booknote*
定义电荷密度
\begin_inset Formula $\rho=\theta(R-r)$
\end_inset

，

\begin_inset Formula $\rho_{0}=\theta(R_{0}-r)$
\end_inset

。
将其在
\begin_inset Formula $R_{0}$
\end_inset

附近展开：

\begin_inset Formula 
\begin{align*}
\rho & =\rho_{0}+(R-R_{0})\delta(r-R_{0})-\frac{1}{2}(R-R_{0})^{2}\delta^{\prime}(r-R_{0})+\dots\\
 & \equiv\rho_{0}+\delta\rho
\end{align*}

\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Booknote*
由于
\begin_inset Formula $R-R_{0}$
\end_inset

是一阶的，
因此我们只需要保留
\begin_inset Formula $\delta^{\prime}$
\end_inset

项。
库伦能：

\begin_inset Formula 
\begin{align*}
E_{C}(\alpha) & =\frac{1}{2}\frac{(Ze)^{2}}{V^{2}}\int\int\frac{\rho(\boldsymbol{r}_{1})\rho(\boldsymbol{r}_{2})}{\left|\boldsymbol{r}_{1}-\boldsymbol{r}_{2}\right|}\,\mathrm{d}^{3}\boldsymbol{r}_{1}\mathrm{d}^{3}\boldsymbol{r}_{2}\\
 & =\frac{1}{2}\frac{(Ze)^{2}}{V^{2}}\int\int\frac{\rho_{0}\rho_{0}+2\rho_{0}\delta\rho+(\delta\rho)^{2}}{\left|\boldsymbol{r}_{1}-\boldsymbol{r}_{2}\right|}\,\mathrm{d}^{3}\boldsymbol{r}_{1}\mathrm{d}^{3}\boldsymbol{r}_{2}
\end{align*}

\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Booknote*
分子上的第一部分计算出来为
\begin_inset Formula $E_{C}(0)$
\end_inset

。
下面计算第二部分，
之后为了方便忽略前面
\begin_inset Formula $(Ze)^{2}/2V^{2}$
\end_inset

的系数：

\begin_inset Formula 
\begin{align*}
\int\int\frac{2\rho_{0}(\boldsymbol{r}_{1})\delta\rho(\boldsymbol{r}_{2})}{\left|\boldsymbol{r}_{1}-\boldsymbol{r}_{2}\right|}\,\mathrm{d}^{3}\boldsymbol{r}_{1}\mathrm{d}^{3}\boldsymbol{r}_{2}
\end{align*}

\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Booknote*
利用球谐函数展开：

\begin_inset Formula 
\[
\frac{1}{\left|\boldsymbol{r}_{1}-\boldsymbol{r}_{2}\right|}=\sum_{\lambda\mu}\frac{4\mathrm{\pi}}{2\lambda+1}\frac{r_{<}^{\lambda}}{r_{>}^{\lambda+1}}Y_{\lambda\mu}^{*}(\Omega_{1})Y_{\lambda\mu}(\Omega_{2})
\]

\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Booknote*
其中
\begin_inset Formula $r_{<}$
\end_inset

表示
\begin_inset Formula $r_{1}$
\end_inset

和
\begin_inset Formula $r_{2}$
\end_inset

中小的那一个，

\begin_inset Formula $r_{>}$
\end_inset

表示
\begin_inset Formula $r_{1}$
\end_inset

和
\begin_inset Formula $r_{2}$
\end_inset

中大的那一个。
我们把展开式代入，
得：

\begin_inset Formula 
\[
8\mathrm{\pi}\sum_{\lambda\mu}\frac{1}{2\lambda+1}\int\int\rho_{0}(\boldsymbol{r}_{1})\delta\rho(\boldsymbol{r}_{2})\frac{r_{<}^{\lambda}}{r_{>}^{\lambda+1}}Y_{\lambda\mu}^{*}(\Omega_{1})Y_{\lambda\mu}(\Omega_{2})\,\mathrm{d}^{3}\boldsymbol{r}_{1}\mathrm{d}^{3}\boldsymbol{r}_{2}
\]

\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Booknote*
由于
\begin_inset Formula $\rho_{0}(\boldsymbol{r}_{1})$
\end_inset

中不含角度，
可以先对
\begin_inset Formula $\Omega_{1}$
\end_inset

积分，
由于
\begin_inset Formula $Y_{00}=1/\sqrt{4\mathrm{\pi}}$
\end_inset

，
我们有：

\begin_inset Formula 
\[
\int\mathrm{d}\Omega_{1}\,Y_{\lambda\mu}^{*}(\Omega_{1})=\sqrt{4\mathrm{\pi}}\delta_{\lambda0}\delta_{\mu0}
\]

\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Booknote*
于是积分被简化为：

\begin_inset Formula 
\[
8\mathrm{\pi}\int\mathrm{d}\Omega_{2}\int_{0}^{R_{0}}r_{1}^{2}\mathrm{d}r_{1}\int r_{2}^{2}\mathrm{d}r_{2}\delta\rho(\boldsymbol{r}_{2})\frac{1}{r_{>}}
\]

\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Booknote*
代入
\begin_inset Formula $\delta\rho(\boldsymbol{r}_{2})$
\end_inset

，
积分化为两项，
第一项为：

\begin_inset Formula 
\[
8\mathrm{\pi}\int\mathrm{d}\Omega_{2}\int_{0}^{R_{0}}r_{1}^{2}\mathrm{d}r_{1}\int r_{2}\mathrm{d}r_{2}(R(\Omega_{2})-R_{0})\delta(r_{2}-R_{0})
\]

\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Booknote*
容易计算得到：

\begin_inset Formula 
\begin{align*}
 & 8\mathrm{\pi}\int\mathrm{d}\Omega_{2}\int_{0}^{R_{0}}r_{1}^{2}\mathrm{d}r_{1}\int r_{2}\mathrm{d}r_{2}(R(\Omega_{2})-R_{0})\delta(r_{2}-R_{0})\\
= & \frac{8\mathrm{\pi}}{3}\int\mathrm{d}\Omega_{2}R_{0}^{4}(R(\Omega_{2})-R_{0})\\
= & \frac{8\mathrm{\pi}}{3}R_{0}^{5}\cdot4\mathrm{\pi}\alpha_{00}\\
= & -\frac{8\mathrm{\pi}}{3}R_{0}^{5}\sum_{\lambda\mu}\left|\alpha_{\lambda\mu}\right|^{2}
\end{align*}

\end_inset

第二项为：

\begin_inset Formula 
\begin{align*}
-4\mathrm{\pi}\int\mathrm{d}\Omega_{2}\int_{0}^{R_{0}}r_{1}^{2}\mathrm{d}r_{1}\int r_{2}^{2}\mathrm{d}r_{2}(R(\Omega_{2})-R_{0})^{2}\delta^{\prime}(r_{2}-R_{0})\frac{1}{r_{<}}
\end{align*}

\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Booknote*
容易计算得到：

\begin_inset Formula 
\begin{align*}
 & -4\mathrm{\pi}\int\mathrm{d}\Omega_{2}\int_{0}^{R_{0}}r_{1}^{2}\mathrm{d}r_{1}\int r_{2}\mathrm{d}r_{2}(R(\Omega_{2})-R_{0})^{2}\delta^{\prime}(r_{2}-R_{0})\\
= & 4\mathrm{\pi}\int\mathrm{d}\Omega_{2}\int_{0}^{R_{0}}r_{1}^{2}\mathrm{d}r_{1}(R(\Omega_{2})-R_{0})^{2}\\
= & \frac{4\mathrm{\pi}}{3}\int\mathrm{d}\Omega_{2}R_{0}^{3}(R(\Omega_{2})-R_{0})^{2}\\
= & \frac{4\mathrm{\pi}}{3}R_{0}^{5}\int\mathrm{d}\Omega_{2}(\sum_{\lambda\mu}\alpha_{\lambda\mu}^{*}Y_{\lambda\mu}(\Omega_{2}))\\
= & \frac{4\mathrm{\pi}}{3}R_{0}^{5}\sum_{\lambda\mu}\left|\alpha_{\lambda\mu}\right|^{2}
\end{align*}

\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Booknote*
两项相加得第二部分为：

\begin_inset Formula 
\[
-\frac{4\mathrm{\pi}}{3}R_{0}^{5}\sum_{\lambda\mu}\left|\alpha_{\lambda\mu}\right|^{2}
\]

\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Booknote*
接下来计算第三部分：

\begin_inset Formula 
\[
\int\int\frac{\delta\rho(\boldsymbol{r}_{1})\delta\rho(\boldsymbol{r}_{2})}{\left|\boldsymbol{r}_{1}-\boldsymbol{r}_{2}\right|}\,\mathrm{d}^{3}\boldsymbol{r}_{1}\mathrm{d}^{3}\boldsymbol{r}_{2}
\]

\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Booknote*
利用球谐函数展开得到：

\begin_inset Formula 
\[
\sum_{\lambda\mu}\frac{4\mathrm{\pi}}{2\lambda+1}\int\int\delta\rho(\boldsymbol{r}_{1})\delta\rho(\boldsymbol{r}_{2})\frac{r_{<}^{\lambda}}{r_{>}^{\lambda+1}}Y_{\lambda\mu}^{*}(\Omega_{1})Y_{\lambda\mu}(\Omega_{2})\,\mathrm{d}^{3}\boldsymbol{r}_{1}\mathrm{d}^{3}\boldsymbol{r}_{2}
\]

\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Booknote*
展开
\begin_inset Formula $\delta\rho(\boldsymbol{r}_{1})$
\end_inset

和
\begin_inset Formula $\delta\rho(\boldsymbol{r}_{2})$
\end_inset

后保留到二阶项后只有一项，
为两个
\begin_inset Formula $\delta$
\end_inset

函数的乘积，
消掉
\begin_inset Formula $\delta$
\end_inset

函数后得到：

\begin_inset Formula 
\[
\sum_{\lambda\mu}\frac{4\mathrm{\pi}}{2\lambda+1}\int\mathrm{d}\Omega_{1}\int\mathrm{d}\Omega_{2}R_{0}^{3}(R(\Omega_{1})-R_{0})(R(\Omega_{2})-R_{0})Y_{\lambda\mu}^{*}(\Omega_{1})Y_{\lambda\mu}(\Omega_{2})
\]

\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Booknote*
这里必定有
\begin_inset Formula $r_{1}=r_{2}=R_{0}$
\end_inset

，
因此
\begin_inset Formula $r_{<}$
\end_inset

和
\begin_inset Formula $r_{>}$
\end_inset

均为
\begin_inset Formula $R_{0}$
\end_inset

。
上式中分别对
\begin_inset Formula $\Omega_{1}$
\end_inset

和
\begin_inset Formula $\Omega_{2}$
\end_inset

积分，
得到：

\end_layout

\begin_layout Booknote*
\begin_inset Formula 
\begin{align*}
4\mathrm{\pi} & R_{0}^{5}\sum_{\lambda\mu}\frac{1}{2\lambda+1}\left|\alpha_{\lambda\mu}\right|^{2}
\end{align*}

\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Booknote*
第二部分和第三部分相加，
得到：

\begin_inset Formula 
\[
-4\mathrm{\pi}R_{0}^{5}\sum_{\lambda\mu}\frac{2(\lambda-1)}{3(2\lambda+1)}\left|\alpha_{\lambda\mu}\right|^{2}
\]

\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Booknote*
乘上前面的系数
\begin_inset Formula $(Ze)^{2}/2V^{2}$
\end_inset

得到：

\begin_inset Formula 
\[
E(\alpha)-E(0)=-\frac{1}{2}\sum_{\lambda\mu}\frac{3(\lambda-1)(Ze)^{2}}{2\mathrm{\pi}(2\lambda+1)R_{0}}\left|\alpha_{\lambda\mu}\right|^{2}
\]

\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
我们由此得到刚度系数（
\begin_inset Formula $\lambda\geq2$
\end_inset

）：

\begin_inset Formula 
\[
C_{\lambda}=(\lambda-1)(\lambda+2)R_{0}^{2}\sigma-\frac{3(\lambda-1)}{2\mathrm{\pi}(2\lambda+1)}\frac{(Ze)^{2}}{R_{0}}
\]

\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
原则上，
我们现在可以计算出原子核的能谱、惯性系数
\begin_inset Formula $B_{\lambda}$
\end_inset

和刚度系数
\begin_inset Formula $C_{\lambda}$
\end_inset

。
然而，
复现出能谱并不是检验一个原子核模型最好的方式。
一个量子态可以被一个波函数表征，
而电磁矩和跃迁概率强烈依赖于波函数，
因此电磁矩和跃迁概率实际上能更好的检验我们的模型

\begin_inset Flex Comment
status collapsed

\begin_layout Plain Layout
这个论述不是很有说服力啊。

\end_layout

\end_inset
。
因此，
在进一步计算之前，
我们先讨论一下这些物理量。

\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
附录B展示了如何计算电磁矩。
需要知道的是电磁多极算符。

\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
长波极限下，
电多极算符可以如下计算：

\begin_inset Formula 
\[
\hat{Q}_{\lambda\mu}=e\int_{V}\rho_{p}(\boldsymbol{r})r^{\lambda}Y_{\lambda\mu}(\theta,\phi)\,\mathrm{d}^{3}\boldsymbol{r}
\]

\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
我们可以用
\begin_inset Formula $\alpha_{\lambda\mu}$
\end_inset

表示出来，
让密度为常数，
考虑
\begin_inset CommandInset ref
LatexCommand ref
reference "eq:expansion of R"
plural "false"
caps "false"
noprefix "false"
nolink "false"

\end_inset

所定义的形状，
得到：

\begin_inset Formula 
\[
\hat{Q}_{\lambda\mu}=\rho_{p}e\int\mathrm{d}\Omega\,Y_{\lambda\mu}(\Omega)\frac{1}{\lambda+3}R^{\lambda+3}(\Omega)
\]

\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
至多到
\begin_inset Formula $\alpha_{\lambda\mu}$
\end_inset

的二阶，
得到：

\begin_inset Formula 
\begin{align*}
\hat{Q}_{\lambda\mu} & =\frac{3e}{4\mathrm{\pi}}ZR_{0}^{\lambda}\Bigggl[\hat{\alpha}_{\lambda\mu}+\frac{1}{2}(\lambda+2)\sum_{\lambda_{1}\mu_{1}}\sum_{\lambda_{2}\mu_{2}}\hat{\alpha}_{\lambda_{1}\mu_{1}}\hat{\alpha}_{\lambda_{2}\mu_{2}}(-)^{\mu}\\
 & \sqrt{\frac{(2\lambda_{1}+1)(2\lambda_{2}+1)(2\lambda+1)}{4\mathrm{\pi}}}\begin{pmatrix}\lambda_{1} & \lambda_{2} & \lambda\\
0 & 0 & 0
\end{pmatrix}\begin{pmatrix}\lambda_{1} & \lambda_{2} & \lambda\\
-\mu_{1} & -\mu_{2} & \mu
\end{pmatrix}\Bigggr]
\end{align*}

\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Booknote*
需要用到公式：

\begin_inset Formula 
\begin{align*}
\int Y_{\lambda_{1}\mu_{1}}(\Omega)Y_{\lambda_{2}\mu_{2}}(\Omega)Y_{\lambda\mu}(\Omega)\,\mathrm{d}\Omega & =\sqrt{\frac{(2\lambda_{1}+1)(2\lambda_{2}+1)(2\lambda+1)}{4\mathrm{\pi}}}\begin{pmatrix}\lambda_{1} & \lambda_{2} & \lambda\\
0 & 0 & 0
\end{pmatrix}\begin{pmatrix}\lambda_{1} & \lambda_{2} & \lambda\\
\mu_{1} & \mu_{2} & \mu
\end{pmatrix}
\end{align*}

\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Booknote*
电多极算符为：

\begin_inset Formula 
\[
\hat{Q}_{\lambda\mu}=\rho_{p}eR_{0}^{\lambda+3}\int\mathrm{d}\Omega\,Y_{\lambda\mu}(\Omega)\frac{1}{\lambda+3}\left(1+\alpha_{00}+\sum_{\lambda\mu}\alpha_{\lambda\mu}^{*}Y_{\lambda\mu}(\Omega)\right)^{\lambda+3}
\]

\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Booknote*
我们只考虑
\begin_inset Formula $\lambda>0$
\end_inset

的情况，
因此对球谐函数的一阶项积分为零，
展开到二阶，
得：

\begin_inset Formula 
\[
\hat{Q}_{\lambda\mu}=\rho_{p}eR_{0}^{\lambda+3}\int\mathrm{d}\Omega\,Y_{\lambda\mu}(\Omega)\left(\sum_{\lambda\mu}\alpha_{\lambda\mu}^{*}Y_{\lambda\mu}(\Omega)+\frac{\lambda+2}{2}\left(\sum_{\lambda\mu}\alpha_{\lambda\mu}^{*}Y_{\lambda\mu}(\Omega)\right)^{2}\right)
\]

\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Booknote*
为了方便对
\begin_inset Formula $R$
\end_inset

取共轭，
再利用
\begin_inset Formula $Y_{\lambda\mu}=(-)^{\mu}Y_{\lambda,-\mu}^{*}$
\end_inset

，
得：

\begin_inset Formula 
\[
\hat{Q}_{\lambda\mu}=\rho_{p}eR_{0}^{\lambda+3}\int\mathrm{d}\Omega\,Y_{\lambda\mu}(\Omega)\left(\sum_{\lambda\mu}\alpha_{\lambda\mu}Y_{\lambda\mu}^{*}(\Omega)+\frac{\lambda+2}{2}\left(\sum_{\lambda\mu}\alpha_{\lambda\mu}(-)^{\mu}Y_{\lambda,-\mu}(\Omega)\right)^{2}\right)
\]

\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Booknote*
第一项可以计算出来为：

\begin_inset Formula 
\[
\rho_{p}eR_{0}^{\lambda+3}\alpha_{\lambda\mu}
\]

\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Booknote*
第二项需要写为：

\begin_inset Formula 
\[
\frac{\lambda+2}{2}\rho_{p}eR_{0}^{\lambda+3}\sum_{\lambda_{1}\mu_{1}}\sum_{\lambda_{2}\mu_{2}}\alpha_{\lambda_{1}\mu_{1}}\alpha_{\lambda_{2}\mu_{2}}(-)^{\mu_{1}+\mu_{2}}\int\mathrm{d}\Omega\,Y_{\lambda\mu}(\Omega)Y_{\lambda_{1},-\mu_{1}}(\Omega)Y_{\lambda_{2},-\mu_{2}}(\Omega)
\]

\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Booknote*
然后利用公式，
再利用3j符号的性质知
\begin_inset Formula $\mu-\mu_{1}-\mu_{2}=0$
\end_inset

，
得第二项为：

\begin_inset Formula 
\begin{align*}
 & \rho_{p}eR_{0}^{\lambda+3}\frac{\lambda+2}{2}\sum_{\lambda_{1}\mu_{1}}\sum_{\lambda_{2}\mu_{2}}\alpha_{\lambda_{1}\mu_{1}}\alpha_{\lambda_{2}\mu_{2}}(-)^{\mu}\\
\times & \sqrt{\frac{(2\lambda_{1}+1)(2\lambda_{2}+1)(2\lambda+1)}{4\mathrm{\pi}}}\begin{pmatrix}\lambda_{1} & \lambda_{2} & \lambda\\
0 & 0 & 0
\end{pmatrix}\begin{pmatrix}\lambda_{1} & \lambda_{2} & \lambda\\
-\mu_{1} & -\mu_{2} & \mu
\end{pmatrix}
\end{align*}

\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Booknote*
第一项第二项相加，
再利用
\begin_inset Formula $\rho_{p}=3Z/(4\mathrm{\pi}R_{0}^{3})$
\end_inset

，
即得：

\begin_inset Formula 
\begin{align*}
\hat{Q}_{\lambda\mu}= & \frac{3e}{4\mathrm{\pi}}ZR_{0}^{\lambda}\Bigggl[\alpha_{\lambda\mu}+\frac{\lambda+2}{2}\sum_{\lambda_{1}\mu_{1}}\sum_{\lambda_{2}\mu_{2}}\alpha_{\lambda_{1}\mu_{1}}\alpha_{\lambda_{2}\mu_{2}}(-)^{\mu}\\
\times & \sqrt{\frac{(2\lambda_{1}+1)(2\lambda_{2}+1)(2\lambda+1)}{4\mathrm{\pi}}}\begin{pmatrix}\lambda_{1} & \lambda_{2} & \lambda\\
0 & 0 & 0
\end{pmatrix}\begin{pmatrix}\lambda_{1} & \lambda_{2} & \lambda\\
-\mu_{1} & -\mu_{2} & \mu
\end{pmatrix}\Bigggr]
\end{align*}

\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
磁多极算符可以如下给出：

\begin_inset Formula 
\[
\hat{M}_{\lambda\mu}=\frac{1}{c(\lambda+1)}\int_{V}(\boldsymbol{r}\times\boldsymbol{j}(\boldsymbol{r}))(\nabla\boldsymbol{r}^{\lambda}Y_{\lambda\mu})\mathrm{d}^{3}\boldsymbol{r}
\]

\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
如同我们之前考虑质量参数

\begin_inset Flex Comment
status collapsed

\begin_layout Plain Layout
我认为是惯性系数和刚度系数，
但原文如此。

\end_layout

\end_inset
，
我们可以再次使用无旋假定来确定流密度
\begin_inset Formula $\boldsymbol{j}$
\end_inset

，
从而把
\begin_inset Formula $\hat{M}_{\lambda\mu}$
\end_inset

用
\begin_inset Formula $\alpha_{\lambda\mu}$
\end_inset

和
\begin_inset Formula $\dot{\alpha}_{\lambda\mu}$
\end_inset

表示出来[Da 68,
 Chap.6]。
然而，
在这里，
我们只考虑
\begin_inset Formula $\hat{M}_{1}$
\end_inset

